«
@@ DMOHisto — demo of the Probability section: a law drawn at random
@@ among nine, with random parameters; 300 values drawn from it by its
@@ Rand entry into ΣData, their histogram in gray (HistogramPlot), and
@@ the density of the law over it, scaled to the counts, in black.
@@ Press again for a new law. The draws stay in ΣData.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  300 RAND 9 * IP R→I 1 +
  → dhhcount dhhk
  «
    @ The law and its parameters
    Case
      dhhk 1 == Then "Norml" 0 RAND 1.5 * 0.5 + 2 RND 2 →List End
      dhhk 2 == Then "LgNrm" 0 RAND 0.5 * 0.3 + 2 RND 2 →List End
      dhhk 3 == Then "Expon" RAND 1.5 * 0.5 + 2 RND 1 →List End
      dhhk 4 == Then "Weibl" RAND 2.5 * 1 + 1 RND 1 2 →List End
      dhhk 5 == Then "TriSym" 0 RAND 2 * 1 + 1 RND 2 →List End
      dhhk 6 == Then "UShape" 0 1 2 →List End
      dhhk 7 == Then "Rayleigh" RAND 1.5 * 0.5 + 2 RND 1 →List End
      dhhk 8 == Then "Logis" 0 RAND 0.5 + 2 RND 2 →List End
      "Chi2" RAND 6 * IP R→I 2 + 1 →List
    End
    → dhhn dhhp
    «
      @ The parameters as text: "a b " for Rand, "a;b;" for PDF
      "" "" 1 dhhp Size For dhhi
        dhhp dhhi Get →Text
        → dhhv « Swap dhhv + " " + Swap dhhv + ";" + »
      Next
      → dhhr dhhs
      «
        ClΣ
        "« 1 " dhhcount →Text + " Start " + dhhr + "Ⓛ" + dhhn + "Rand Σ+ Next »" + Str→ Eval
        MinΣ MaxΣ
        → dhhlo dhhhi
        «
          dhhhi dhhlo - 0.05 *
          → dhhm
          «
            dhhlo dhhm - dhhhi dhhm +
            → dhha dhhb
            «
              dhhb dhha - 25 /
              "« → dhhx « " dhhr + "dhhx Ⓛ" + dhhn + "PDF » »" + Str→
              → dhhw dhhpdf
              «
                @ The highest density over the range, for the vertical scale
                0 0 60 For dhhj
                  dhha dhhb dhha - dhhj * 60 / + 'dhhpdf' Rcl Eval Max
                Next
                dhhcount dhhw * * 1.35 *
                → dhhy
                «
                  @ 25 bins of width dhhw, whatever the StatsPlotBins setting
                  dhha dhhb XRange dhhy -40 / dhhy YRange dhhw Res
                  RclΣ 0.5 Gray Foreground HistogramPlot 'Foreground' Purge
                  2 LineWidth
                  "'" dhhcount →Text + "*" + dhhw →Text + "*Ⓛ" + dhhn + "PDF(" + dhhs + "X)'" + Str→
                  FunctionPlot 'LineWidth' Purge
                  dhhn "Rand " + dhhr + "— " + dhhcount →Text + " draws" +
                  { #0d #2d 0 true false } DrawText
                  'PPAR' Purge
                  dhhn dhhp 2 →List "law" →Tag
                »
              »
            »
          »
        »
      »
    »
  »
»
